# Who reviews changes to this repo.
#
# Every file, so that every pull request goes past a second pair of eyes before
# it reaches the published wiki.
#
# Note on plans: GitHub only applies CODEOWNERS on a PRIVATE repository if the
# organisation is on a paid plan. uwigem is on the free plan today, so this file
# does not auto-request anything on its own. It is here because it documents
# ownership, and because it starts working the moment the org upgrades or the
# repo is made public.
#
# What actually requests the review today is .github/workflows/request-review.yml,
# which asks on every pull request. If you change the reviewer, change it in both
# places.
#
# A team handle would be better than a single person once one exists. The
# previous version of this file pointed at @uwigem/igem2026, which GitHub
# rejected on all twelve lines: a team only counts as an owner if it is visible
# and has write access to this repository. Check any change here with:
#
#   gh api repos/uwigem/wiki2026/codeowners/errors

